  "description": "Dependency-injection registration for ArchPillar.Extensions.Localization. Configures the ambient store from LocalizerOptions and registers the native localization views — ILocalizer, ILocalizer<T>, and a concrete Localizer — for injection. The core runtime stays dependency-free; this adapter is optional. For IStringLocalizer interop while migrating, add ArchPillar.Extensions.Localization.StringLocalizer.",
